WHAT THIS SCHEMA IS. The whole účtovná závierka in one document: root
`dokument`, with `telo` carrying `ucPod1Suvaha` (145 rows, tRiadok14 =
brutto/korekcia/netto/netto-minulé) beside `ucPod2VykazZS` (61 rows,
tRiadok12 = bežné/minulé). It stamps itself only "Suvaha", which understates
what it contains.

⚠️ THIS MODULE PREVIOUSLY SHIPPED TWO INVENTED SCHEMAS. `uzsuv_schema.xsd`
and `uzvzs_schema.xsd` (7 elements each, roots UZSUV / UZVZS) were
hand-written stand-ins; those roots exist nowhere in anything FS SR publishes.
The templates said so — "WORKING STAND-IN … replace with the official FS SR
UZPODv14 structure before live filing" — but the version records and the
schema files did not, so an export validated cleanly against a schema no
authority had ever seen. Both are deleted. If you find a reference to either,
it is stale.

NOT SHIPPED, and deliberately:
  uzmuj-2014.xsd  — Účtovná závierka MIKRO účtovnej jednotky. A different
  form for companies under the micro thresholds, which this module does not
  model at all. A mikro účtovná jednotka files UZMUJ, not UZPOD.
  vp_uct2015.xsd  — the všeobecné podanie wrapper both závierky are submitted
  inside. Out of scope until submission is automated.

REFRESH PROCEDURE
  1. Fetch https://ekr.financnasprava.sk/Formulare/XSD/uzpod-2014.xsd and
     compare the md5 with the line here.
  2. Check the status code, not the size: a miss returns 404 with a
     ~1 245-byte HTML error page.
  3. Probe for a _v2 suffix as well as a newer year — that is how FS SR
     published a DPPO revision (dppo2025_v2.xsd beside an unchanged
     dppo2025.xsd), and a digest comparison on the pinned name cannot see it.
